	"_doc": "The built-in button migration's look cases, in the OLD attribute names (addToCart*, cta*, cta2*, loginButton*, registerButton*). probe.mjs renders each case through a checkout's real render.php (the QA harness) or, for sgs/account's form buttons, through includes/account/helpers-account-look-css.php::sgs_account_login_look_css, then measures the computed look of every listed button in Chromium. Run on the base checkout it writes the pinned looks; run on the migrated checkout with --sweep it first renames and reshapes each case's attributes through the sweep's own function (scripts/lib/builtin-button-sweep.php) and must measure the same looks. `mamas-*` cases are the real saved values on the local Mama's mirror (pages 103, 628; templates 202, 194, 154's buy box); `rich-*` cases set every old setting the block carries, so a rename that drops one shows.",
